# 只有 deploy/mysql/Dockerfile 会用"仓库根目录"当构建上下文(把 init.sql 拷进镜像),
# 另外两个镜像的上下文分别是 inkwell_backend/ 和 inkwell_frontend/, 各有自己的 .dockerignore。
# 这里只管把根目录里不需要的东西挡在上下文外面: 传得少一点, 构建快一点。
.git
.github
.gitignore
.dockerignore
.idea
.vscode
.DS_Store

# 前端源码(以及它可能留下的 node_modules/dist)这个镜像里用不到
inkwell_frontend
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/*.log

# 后端只需要 init.sql, 其余都不用进上下文
inkwell_backend/Dockerfile
inkwell_backend/.dockerignore
inkwell_backend/docker-compose.yml
inkwell_backend/wait-for.sh
inkwell_backend/.air.conf
inkwell_backend/cmd
inkwell_backend/conf
inkwell_backend/controller
inkwell_backend/dao
inkwell_backend/docs
inkwell_backend/log
inkwell_backend/logger
inkwell_backend/logic
inkwell_backend/models
inkwell_backend/pkg
inkwell_backend/routers
inkwell_backend/settings
inkwell_backend/tmp
inkwell_backend/main.go
inkwell_backend/go.mod
inkwell_backend/go.sum
inkwell_backend/.gitignore
inkwell_backend/README.md

